WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:34.790 --> 01:37.390
This is the image we got
from our long-range sensors.

01:37.390 --> 01:38.960
It's a mission.

01:38.960 --> 01:41.000
Classification code Delta 6.

01:41.000 --> 01:44.560
According to the data we
scanned, it is operational.

01:45.930 --> 01:50.240
You want to drop by to replenish
supplies and gather information, right?

01:50.240 --> 01:55.510
However, there isn't any guarantee
they'll welcome us with open arms.

01:55.510 --> 01:58.880
There is the possibility
that it's a nest for our enemies.

01:58.880 --> 02:01.920
Just debating the
possibilities is useless.

02:01.920 --> 02:04.220
I will take charge of this operation.

02:04.220 --> 02:05.790
Please allow me to.

02:05.790 --> 02:08.190
Before that...

02:08.190 --> 02:12.030
Why don't we try talking to them?

02:12.030 --> 02:13.020
Roger.

02:18.800 --> 02:20.100
What?

02:20.100 --> 02:23.440
Someone using a frontier ship
communication pattern nowadays?

02:23.440 --> 02:25.170
What kinda hicks are you?

02:25.170 --> 02:26.740
What's with that attitude?

02:26.740 --> 02:29.380
How rude.

02:29.380 --> 02:31.510
We are from Mejale.

02:31.510 --> 02:35.620
We are in need of supplies
and rest from a long journey.

02:35.620 --> 02:38.450
We would like to dock for a while.

02:38.450 --> 02:40.890
Share our supplies?

02:40.890 --> 02:42.120
You've got to be kidding!

02:42.120 --> 02:43.960
We're in a big bind, too!

02:43.960 --> 02:47.960
Quit talking in your sleep and get lost!

02:47.960 --> 02:51.830
We have excellent engineers on board.

02:51.830 --> 02:55.500
If you would like,
we can assist in system repairs.

02:59.610 --> 03:02.080
The rule here is eat or be eaten!

03:02.080 --> 03:05.610
If you don't care what happens to you,
do what you like!

03:05.610 --> 03:08.750
I believe we'll mind our manners.

03:08.750 --> 03:10.920
The vice-captain sure says a mouthful.

03:10.920 --> 03:13.250
From here, we will contact the Mission.

03:13.250 --> 03:18.160
I'm sure you've had docking training,
oh Mr. Wonderful Navigator?

03:18.160 --> 03:20.360
O-Of course!

03:20.360 --> 03:22.020
Completely perfect!

03:37.910 --> 03:39.650
What's up, Barnette?

03:39.650 --> 03:42.420
What are you doing,
bringing those things in?

03:42.420 --> 03:43.950
Well...

03:43.950 --> 03:47.820
...this is the first chance we've had for
hand-to-hand combat in quite a while!

03:47.820 --> 03:49.620
Is everyone here?

03:49.620 --> 03:53.730
We'll be the lead party
infiltrating the Mission.

03:53.730 --> 03:55.760
Avoid all unnecessary conflict.

03:55.760 --> 03:57.420
I'll go with you!

03:59.500 --> 04:02.470
I know how to deal with rugged men!

04:02.470 --> 04:06.810
If you leave it to me,
I'm sure the negotiations will be smooth!

04:06.810 --> 04:09.580
Oh, can you get
my partner in there, too?

04:09.580 --> 04:12.880
That doesn't sound convincing at all.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.580
You need a guard ship, too?

04:14.580 --> 04:17.550
I'll volunteer!

04:17.550 --> 04:18.750
Volunteer?

04:18.750 --> 04:20.420
You've already left.

04:20.420 --> 04:21.990
Oh, it's all right.

04:21.990 --> 04:24.760
Taking them will be less
trouble than leaving them.

04:24.760 --> 04:26.690
- That's true.
- That's true.

04:26.690 --> 04:28.630
What? Did you say something?

04:38.070 --> 04:40.480
Entering docking sequence.

04:40.480 --> 04:42.140
Roger, go for it.

04:48.380 --> 04:50.620
Approaching the specified gate, K-2.

04:50.620 --> 04:52.020
Dita, go to M-5.

04:52.020 --> 04:53.680
Roger!

05:18.450 --> 05:19.880
Don't come close!

05:19.880 --> 05:23.150
If you come any closer, I'll shoot!

05:23.150 --> 05:25.350
Well, well... What a place.

05:31.390 --> 05:34.690
Wow, this looks like
it's deserving of repair.

05:43.040 --> 05:45.410
Wow, amazing!

05:45.410 --> 05:46.470
Stop it, you idiot!

05:46.470 --> 05:47.440
Geez!

05:47.440 --> 05:48.510
Why?

05:48.510 --> 05:50.550
He's just scared about everything.

05:50.550 --> 05:52.210
Shut up!

05:57.690 --> 05:59.350
This way.

06:04.090 --> 06:07.460
- You're really sexy, lady!
- Hey, they're all women!

06:07.460 --> 06:12.460
- Come here and join us for a drink!
- I can't get enough of that ass!

06:20.070 --> 06:21.740
So cute!

06:23.380 --> 06:27.440
What are you lookin' at?

06:29.280 --> 06:31.450
L-Little brat.

06:31.450 --> 06:35.320
Even pride as a human is questionable.

06:35.320 --> 06:37.930
Looks like we don't have to worry.

06:37.930 --> 06:42.530
There isn't anything especially
suspicious other than human life signs.

06:42.530 --> 06:45.470
What about the weapons system
or the defense system?

06:45.470 --> 06:48.840
I want to know who they are.

06:48.840 --> 06:51.740
I agree. I'm interested as well.

06:51.740 --> 06:54.500
Then let's try a spectral analysis.

06:55.640 --> 06:59.550
This atmosphere is hard to approach,
but I'll check it anyway.

06:59.550 --> 07:01.650
You know, you're going to lose friends.

07:01.650 --> 07:02.980
Can you leave me alone?

07:11.430 --> 07:13.590
Who's responsible here!

07:13.590 --> 07:15.460
I want to speak with the leader!

07:17.700 --> 07:20.970
We've got a rather
boisterous guest here.

07:20.970 --> 07:25.310
It looks like this will be lots of fun.

07:25.310 --> 07:27.510
Are you the leader here?

07:27.510 --> 07:30.180
Nothing that great...

07:30.180 --> 07:33.920
...but there isn't a guy here
with enough guts to challenge me.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.520
Right, Patch?

07:35.520 --> 07:37.290
Of course!

07:37.290 --> 07:40.620
It would mean death to
go against you, Miss Liz.

07:43.090 --> 07:45.630
So, Patch, who are these people?

07:45.630 --> 07:47.460
Well, they're...

07:47.460 --> 07:50.430
We are from Mejale.

07:50.430 --> 07:53.430
Guests from the other
side of the magnetic storm?

07:53.430 --> 07:55.840
No wonder you talk like that.

07:55.840 --> 07:57.540
Magnetic storm?

07:57.540 --> 08:00.880
Looks like they know about us.

08:00.880 --> 08:03.710
I guess that's why they make fun of us.

08:03.710 --> 08:06.750
It isn't like we're asking for much.

08:06.750 --> 08:11.150
We ask only to replenish what supplies
we lack and for a moment's rest.

08:11.150 --> 08:15.180
In exchange, we would like to
share our technical know-how.

08:16.620 --> 08:19.260
It's not like we're in trouble here.

08:19.260 --> 08:22.230
The only thing we
lack is entertainment.

08:22.230 --> 08:25.300
I don't quite understand
what you're saying.

08:25.300 --> 08:28.040
What you want, you take by force.

08:28.040 --> 08:30.100
That's the rule here.

08:30.100 --> 08:32.000
In other words, fight?

08:35.510 --> 08:37.080
Captain, what should we do?

08:37.080 --> 08:38.750
No need to worry.

08:38.750 --> 08:42.380
We have to give BC some
breathing room every so often.

08:42.380 --> 08:43.820
I see.

08:43.820 --> 08:45.650
How about a 5-on-5?

08:45.650 --> 08:48.860
I'll share supplies with
you if even one of you can win.

08:48.860 --> 08:51.260
That's fine! I'll do it!

08:51.260 --> 08:52.760
Who's first?

08:52.760 --> 08:54.420
Mr. Alien...

08:55.700 --> 08:57.200
No need for handicaps!

08:57.200 --> 09:01.500
How about just a final match
between representatives?

09:01.500 --> 09:05.270
I'm sure that you will be my opponent?

09:05.270 --> 09:06.710
That's fine!

09:06.710 --> 09:08.010
Miss Liz...

09:08.010 --> 09:09.640
What would you like to use?

09:09.640 --> 09:12.180
Anything other than thrown
weapons is fine with me.

09:12.180 --> 09:14.950
No need for you to worry.

09:14.950 --> 09:17.150
What kind of thing is she carrying?

09:17.150 --> 09:19.450
It suits her so well, it's scary.

09:19.450 --> 09:24.330
It's been a while since
BC last used that thing.

09:24.330 --> 09:27.560
When will the gong ring?

09:27.560 --> 09:29.220
Miss...

09:31.930 --> 09:36.770
Do you know what
I hate most in this world?

09:36.770 --> 09:38.070
I'll ask.

09:38.070 --> 09:41.880
Someone who has a knowing
smirk just like you!

09:41.880 --> 09:45.450
I'll return those words straight at you.

09:45.450 --> 09:49.250
I'll cut up that
chatterbox of yours first!

09:49.250 --> 09:53.920
Even from the outside, there are
several faults in its defense system.

09:53.920 --> 09:57.830
Many blank spots in the
radar system as well. That means...

09:57.830 --> 10:01.800
I can't believe the inhabitants
choose to live here.

10:01.800 --> 10:03.630
What's this?

10:03.630 --> 10:06.400
It looks like damage
sustained relatively recently.

10:07.500 --> 10:12.400
That means the people here
are also fighting something.

10:16.080 --> 10:18.010
What's this?

10:33.090 --> 10:34.630
A-Amazing!

10:34.630 --> 10:36.220
Vice-captain, you're so cool!

10:43.740 --> 10:46.470
You entertain me quite well.

10:46.470 --> 10:49.840
Would you like me to
cut it a little closer?

10:50.950 --> 10:52.670
Don't mock me!

11:02.820 --> 11:05.190
You! That's not fair!

11:05.190 --> 11:07.130
- Get out of my way!
- Stop fooling around!

11:09.460 --> 11:11.770
Looks like the match is over.

11:11.770 --> 11:13.260
This is it!

11:19.010 --> 11:20.880
Rabat!

11:20.880 --> 11:22.710
It's Mr. Storemaster!

11:22.710 --> 11:24.370
That guy...

11:25.480 --> 11:30.050
I come by for the first time in a while,
and you're doing something interesting.

11:30.050 --> 11:34.420
Stop with the petty tricks and
entertain us a little more, Patch!

11:36.860 --> 11:39.160
N-N-N-N-N-No...

11:48.270 --> 11:50.860
Where did you come in from?

11:52.440 --> 11:55.580
The security here is
full of unguarded areas.

11:55.580 --> 11:57.780
Just like you.

11:57.780 --> 12:01.080
How many times do you have to piss
me off before you're satisfied?

12:01.080 --> 12:02.250
I don't know.

12:02.250 --> 12:04.580
I haven't bothered to count.

12:07.560 --> 12:09.220
What?

12:17.000 --> 12:20.030
Enemies! They're attacking from
the radar web's blind spots!

12:20.030 --> 12:22.870
They've already attached to the
Mission's residential quarters!

12:22.870 --> 12:24.870
Young man, undock!

12:24.870 --> 12:26.970
We're going to pound
the enemies outside!

12:26.970 --> 12:29.610
But don't harm the Mission.

12:29.610 --> 12:32.510
I'm can't do something so adept.

12:32.510 --> 12:35.420
Roger. Dread team, scramble.

12:35.420 --> 12:38.180
Wow, she's so cool!

12:51.530 --> 12:55.700
There are many enemies coming in
simultaneously from several places!

12:55.700 --> 12:57.240
What's the meaning of this?

12:57.240 --> 12:58.770
You can just leave them alone.

12:58.770 --> 12:59.870
These are...

12:59.870 --> 13:03.880
...refugees who have escaped the harvest.

13:03.880 --> 13:07.780
In other words, a group of
outcasts ousted from the field.

13:07.780 --> 13:12.750
They wandered around and eventually
gathered in this dump of a mission.

13:12.750 --> 13:15.990
They come bother us when we're
about to forget about them.

13:15.990 --> 13:17.590
Like they're taunting us.

13:17.590 --> 13:19.330
Vice-captain!

13:19.330 --> 13:21.660
I think they've sniffed us out!

13:21.660 --> 13:23.730
They're headed straight this way!

13:23.730 --> 13:25.870
What's the safest place around here?

13:25.870 --> 13:29.900
Uh, well... The main control room
in the central area, I think.

13:29.900 --> 13:32.010
Then lead everyone there immediately!

13:32.010 --> 13:33.740
BC!

13:33.740 --> 13:36.310
Gascogne and Parfet, lead the civilians.

13:36.310 --> 13:39.710
Barnette, Jura, and I will take
the rear and buy some time.

13:39.710 --> 13:43.480
Hibiki and Dita, return to the shuttle
and get rid of the enemies outside.

13:43.480 --> 13:45.020
I'll leave your route up to Pyoro.

13:45.020 --> 13:46.720
All right! Let's go get 'em!

13:46.720 --> 13:50.620
But I'm not so sure we
can arrive there safely.

13:50.620 --> 13:53.290
- See?
- You serious?

14:01.500 --> 14:03.300
Ah!

14:03.300 --> 14:05.570
They've overcome the security gate!

14:05.570 --> 14:08.440
Their persistence is nothing new, right?

14:08.440 --> 14:09.410
Let's go.

14:09.410 --> 14:11.070
Oh, wait!

14:14.820 --> 14:17.020
Divert the enemy's attention to us.

14:17.020 --> 14:19.020
Get them far away from the Mission.

14:19.020 --> 14:20.680
Roger!

14:23.560 --> 14:25.220
Here they come.

14:34.240 --> 14:36.640
The prism effect?

14:36.640 --> 14:38.760
Don't come near me!

14:41.540 --> 14:43.680
W-What are they, sheesh.

14:43.680 --> 14:46.480
If beams don't work,
then use a physical attack.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.140
Jura, use this.

14:49.920 --> 14:50.850
Geez!

14:50.850 --> 14:53.340
I hate sticky things!

14:55.190 --> 14:57.950
This is how hand-to-hand
combat should be!

15:02.900 --> 15:05.500
How are they?

15:05.500 --> 15:07.870
Aren't they amusing?

15:11.310 --> 15:12.970
Out of bullets.

15:15.440 --> 15:16.380
Just you watch...

15:16.380 --> 15:18.380
I'll borrow this.

15:18.380 --> 15:20.810
Oh, Vice-captain, can you use...

15:24.450 --> 15:25.720
Did you say something?

15:25.720 --> 15:27.380
No, nothing...

15:29.720 --> 15:31.710
They're attacking from both sides.

15:36.700 --> 15:40.570
I can't let guests
show off the whole time.

15:41.670 --> 15:43.330
Vice-captain!

15:45.410 --> 15:46.870
Oh, brother.

15:46.870 --> 15:51.010
This is a show of who's
more socially inept. Geez.

15:51.010 --> 15:53.710
I guess it's not the
time to sit back and watch!

15:57.790 --> 16:00.990
How far do we have to climb? Sheesh.

16:00.990 --> 16:02.090
Hurry!

16:02.090 --> 16:04.430
The enemy is approaching fast!

16:04.430 --> 16:05.530
Shut up!

16:05.530 --> 16:08.100
It pisses me off when you...

16:08.100 --> 16:09.900
Oh no!

16:09.900 --> 16:11.560
Sorry.

16:18.740 --> 16:20.270
- Bart!
- No good!

16:20.270 --> 16:23.180
I can get rid of them,
but the Mission will take damage!

16:23.180 --> 16:25.350
Get them further away!

16:25.350 --> 16:27.140
You make it sound simple.

16:31.850 --> 16:34.510
Geez, how many are there?

16:40.030 --> 16:41.860
No good over here!

16:41.860 --> 16:44.350
Okay. Jura, Barnette, hurry!

16:45.770 --> 16:48.500
A-Are we there yet?

16:48.500 --> 16:51.610
If we open this thing...

16:51.610 --> 16:53.270
They're here!

16:59.180 --> 17:01.180
Well? Can we get them off?

17:01.180 --> 17:03.180
What does it look like to you?

17:03.180 --> 17:04.280
What are you doing?

17:04.280 --> 17:06.990
I thought I left you
in charge of the civilians!

17:06.990 --> 17:09.320
That's what I intend to do now.

17:09.320 --> 17:12.220
You're the ones that caught up.

17:17.100 --> 17:19.860
- Out of stock.
- Me too.

17:23.170 --> 17:24.830
Hurry, Barnette!

17:31.680 --> 17:36.780
In any case, if they get through
here, our lives are theirs.

17:36.780 --> 17:38.920
The enemy is approaching
the central area!

17:38.920 --> 17:40.720
At this rate, everyone will...

17:43.060 --> 17:45.260
There's movement in the docking bay!

17:45.260 --> 17:48.160
It's Dita's ship and the Vanguard!

17:48.160 --> 17:51.530
They really do keep us on the edge.

17:51.530 --> 17:53.520
Let's start a riot!

18:10.380 --> 18:12.550
What's this?

18:12.550 --> 18:16.820
This is the first time I've seen this!
What a perverted-looking cockpit!

18:16.820 --> 18:18.530
I even smell eros...

18:18.530 --> 18:20.190
Shut up, you!

18:20.190 --> 18:22.760
You know, Mr. Alien...

18:22.760 --> 18:24.430
W-What?

18:24.430 --> 18:26.300
It's different than usual.

18:26.300 --> 18:27.630
Why are you dazed?

18:27.630 --> 18:30.040
BC and the others are in danger!

18:30.040 --> 18:31.700
That's right!

18:33.570 --> 18:36.280
They'll break though in a matter of time.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.940
Oh no!

18:47.390 --> 18:49.190
They're changing structure.

18:49.190 --> 18:50.850
What an enemy.

18:54.190 --> 18:56.190
Sorry to keep you waiting!

18:58.300 --> 19:00.930
Blue Kachina...

19:00.930 --> 19:05.890
If you intentionally kept us waiting,
I won't let you live.

19:09.610 --> 19:12.350
Bart, how is it now?

19:12.350 --> 19:14.970
All right! Let's go!

19:24.730 --> 19:27.130
All enemies destroyed!

19:27.130 --> 19:29.620
Everyone on the Mission is safe, too!

19:42.210 --> 19:45.980
I think I see why you sided with them.

19:45.980 --> 19:49.850
It's rare that you see people
this good-natured lately.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.760
Hey, you can't!

19:58.760 --> 20:01.060
Please, stay quiet just for now!

20:01.060 --> 20:02.560
Excuse me...

20:02.560 --> 20:06.500
I'll quietly sacrifice
myself this one time.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.670
Please lick me gently.

20:08.670 --> 20:12.370
This makes it all for nothing!

20:12.370 --> 20:14.030
37 times.

20:16.840 --> 20:20.570
The number of times that
you've made me fret.

20:22.050 --> 20:23.820
That many times?

20:23.820 --> 20:26.080
We've been together a long time.

20:44.040 --> 20:46.600
All right. I got it, Utan.

20:48.340 --> 20:50.280
Next time, I guess.

20:50.280 --> 20:52.940
Yeah, next time.

20:55.580 --> 20:58.450
- That's an adult relationship?
- So lonely...

20:58.450 --> 21:00.690
So lonely it is, Miss!

21:00.690 --> 21:03.090
There, there. Want a drink?

21:07.490 --> 21:09.830
You have to look for it!

21:09.830 --> 21:12.600
I'll never find it again if you don't.

21:12.600 --> 21:16.040
They've all fulfilled their duties,
so I'm sure they're happy!

21:16.040 --> 21:17.800
Why don't you give up?

21:17.800 --> 21:19.210
You've got to be kidding!

21:19.210 --> 21:22.180
Do you know just how amazing
a vintage item that is?

21:22.180 --> 21:26.450
That Calico pistol is a really
rare item just by itself!

21:26.450 --> 21:28.780
Hey, are you listening?
